  "content": {
    "title": "Observability for developers building connectors",
    "title_en": "Observability for developers building connectors",
    "summary": "",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "b001",
        "type": "heading",
        "inlines": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Monitor, debug, and improve connectors"
          }
        ],
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "b002",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "inlines": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Published connectors in the "
          },
          {
            "type": "link",
            "attrs": {
              "url": "https://claude.ai/directory/connectors"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "directory"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " now have a dashboard showing how they’re performing across Claude product surfaces. Connector owners can use it to:"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "b006",
        "type": "list",
        "attrs": {
          "ordered": false
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "id": "b003",
            "type": "list_item",
            "inlines": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Track adoption."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " Monitor active users, total tool calls, and directory rank over time."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "b004",
            "type": "list_item",
            "inlines": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Diagnose errors and latency."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " See health score, error rates, and latency at a glance, with per-tool error breakdowns to pinpoint what's failing."
              },
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "‍"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "b005",
            "type": "list_item",
            "inlines": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Break down usage by product."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " Compare tool calls across Claude, Claude Code, Cowork, and more to understand where users are engaging."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "b007",
        "type": "image",
        "attrs": {
          "url": "https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68a44d4040f98a4adf2207b6/6a26eb0505466f798299b38a_MCP%20Observability.png",
          "alt": "Stylized view of observability for connectors. Data is illustrative."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "b008",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "inlines": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Available today in public beta. Find it in Claude under"
          },
          {
            "type": "link",
            "attrs": {
              "url": "https://claude.ai/admin-settings/directory/submissions"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " Directory"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " in"
          },
          {
            "type": "link",
            "attrs": {
              "url": "https://claude.ai/admin-settings/organization"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " Organization settings"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". Requires Admin or Owner access on a Team or Enterprise plan. On Enterprise, Owners can also delegate access with a "
          },
          {
            "type": "link",
            "attrs": {
              "url": "https://support.claude.com/en/articles/13930452-manage-custom-roles-on-enterprise-plans"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "custom role"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " that has the Directory management or Libraries permission."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "b009",
        "type": "heading",
        "inlines": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Joining the directory"
          }
        ],
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "b010",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "inlines": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Connectors are built on the"
          },
          {
            "type": "link",
            "attrs": {
              "url": "https://modelcontextprotocol.io/docs/getting-started/intro"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " Model Context Protocol (MCP)"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". There are over 300 third-party connectors in the"
          },
          {
            "type": "link",
            "attrs": {
              "url": "https://claude.ai/directory/connectors"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " directory"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", used by millions of people every day. If you wish to submit your MCP server to the directory, you can now do so directly in Claude."
          },
          {
            "type": "strong",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " "
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "link",
            "attrs": {
              "url": "https://claude.com/docs/connectors/building/submission"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Learn more"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
